            "review_title": "Review at Running Bird Banh My",
            "review_text": "Brett MacDougall\nNew Glasgow, Canada5 contributions\n1\nBest Bánh Mì in Vietnam\nOct 2019\nThis is not a drill. There is no better sandwich in the country. I have eaten countless bánh mì from Hanoi to Ho Chi Minh and I am telling you, you are doing yourself a disservice if you visit the city and you don't eat here. I spent just over a week in Saigon last year and ate here at minimum once a day. I regret nothing.\n\nAsk yourself: would someone really take the time to find a random street cart on TripAdvisor and write a review if it wasn't a mindblowing experience?\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 8, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
