            "review_title": "Review at Running Bird Banh My",
            "review_text": "Phil\nTulum, Mexico24 contributions\n0\nTasty!!! And Cheap!\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nTook us a couple nights to track this food stand down as we were staying nearby. It was recommended by our Vietnamese host - they take the cart out around 5pm until they sell out so they may not be there every night if it’s late. We went there around 5:30-6pm a few times no worries.\n\n70p for a roast pork Banh Mi great value! Or get 2 and try the chicken. They are usually first stall on the main road and always wear yellow tops.\n\nThe will whip up your Banh Mi in 30 secs! They don’t go out till early evening so the meat hasn’t been sat there all day like some stalls.\n\nWould recommend!\nRead more\nWritten February 16, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
