            "review_title": "Review at Running Bird Banh My",
            "review_text": "Elliott G\nBristol, United Kingdom32 contributions\n1\nBrilliant Banh Mi!\nSep 2016 • Couples\nI have had a great deal of banh mi during my total of 4 and a half months in Vietnam so far. A long time in Vietnam means a large amount of banh mi has been consumed. This place, of all the places I have visited, is probably the second best (the best being one in Hoi An).\n\nThe meat (I had thit heo, which is pork meat) is fresh and juicy and the seem to put all of the right toppings in (although pate would be a good option to include). They ask you how spicy you want it and it will literally be made in under a minute! Good for people who are on the go and need a quick fix of a delicious vietnamese sandwich.\n\nEasy stall to find in Saigon and well worth it! Cheap price is a bonus!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 22, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
